              "value": "Extend Strands"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "The roper extends or retracts six thin, sticky tendrils from its body. While the strands are extended, the roper takes a \u20134 circumstance penalty to Stealth checks, and while they're retracted, it can't use its strand Strikes."
            },
